{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":1260160,"duration_api_ms":1240837,"num_turns":90,"result":"Now let me produce the execution payload JSON.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"Added a reusable SimTracer facility to tank_core that records per-tick, per-system pool deltas at configurable verbosity levels. Created crates/tank_core/src/tracing.rs with Verbosity enum (Off/Summary/Detail/Trace), PoolDelta/SystemTraceEntry/TickTrace record types, TraceSink trait with JsonLinesSink and StderrSink implementations, PoolSnapshot for capturing 30 simulation pools, and SimTracer as the main tracer stored as Option<SimTracer> on Engine for zero overhead when off. Integrated into Engine via a TickContext that bundles both budget tracking and tracing, wrapping all system calls in maybe_record_stage to capture before/after pool snapshots and compute deltas. Added 13 integration tests covering detail/summary verbosity, JSON-lines output, zero-overhead verification, budget+trace compatibility, drain/disable lifecycle, and per-system delta inspection. Retrofitted the dissolved_oxygen reaeration test to assert using trace output instead of state snapshots.\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"description\": \"Created crates/tank_core/src/tracing.rs with Verbosity enum, PoolDelta/SystemTraceEntry/TickTrace record types (all Serialize/Deserialize), TraceSink trait, JsonLinesSink and StderrSink implementations, PoolSnapshot capturing 30 pools from TankState, TickTraceBuilder for per-tick accumulation, and SimTracer with in-memory recording plus optional external sink. Includes 4 unit tests.\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"description\": \"Registered tracing module in lib.rs (pub mod tracing) and added re-exports: Verbosity, SimTracer, PoolDelta, SystemTraceEntry, TickTrace, TraceSink, JsonLinesSink, StderrSink.\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"description\": \"Integrated tracer into Engine: added Option<SimTracer> field with enable_tracing/disable_tracing/tracer/tracer_mut methods. Introduced TickContext bundling budget and trace state. Modified maybe_record_stage and maybe_record_stage_with_explicit_budget to capture PoolSnapshots and record SystemTraceEntries when tracing active. Implemented manual Debug/Clone/PartialEq for Engine to handle non-Clone SimTracer field.\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"description\": \"Created crates/tank_core/tests/tracing.rs with 13 integration tests: tracing_off_by_default_no_tracer, tracing_records_one_tick_per_hour_at_detail, detail_verbosity_captures_per_system_pool_deltas, summary_verbosity_records_systems_without_pool_deltas, feed_action_shows_detritus_increase_in_trace, inspect_per_system_deltas_for_specific_pool, daily_systems_appear_on_day_boundary_ticks, json_lines_output_produces_valid_parseable_records, json_lines_output_is_jq_compatible, tracing_does_not_alter_simulation_results, tracing_compatible_with_budget_tracking, drain_ticks_frees_memory, disable_tracing_returns_tracer_with_data.\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 5,\n      \"description\": \"Retrofitted dissolved_oxygen.rs: added tracing_shows_do_system_positive_deltas_during_reaeration test that uses trace output to verify the dissolved_oxygen system produces positive water.do_mg deltas per tick during reaeration from zero.\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 6,\n      \"description\": \"Ran cargo build, cargo test, cargo clippy, cargo fmt --check. All 17 new tests pass. 2 pre-existing budget_tracking failures are unrelated (shrimp reproduction, high mortality conservation). No new clippy warnings. Format clean.\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"cargo build --package tank_core compiles with only 1 pre-existing dead_code warning\",\n    \"13 tracing integration tests pass: detail/summary verbosity, JSON-lines output, zero-overhead, budget compatibility, drain/disable\",\n    \"4 dissolved_oxygen tests pass including the retrofitted tracing_shows_do_system_positive_deltas_during_reaeration test\",\n    \"4 unit tests in tracing.rs pass: verbosity_ordering, pool_delta_only_includes_changes, tick_trace_json_roundtrip, json_lines_sink_produces_valid_output, system_trace_entry_delta_helpers\",\n    \"tracing_does_not_alter_simulation_results test confirms identical snapshots with and without tracing enabled over 24 hours\",\n    \"json_lines_output_is_jq_compatible test verifies each JSON line has pool/before/after/delta fields\",\n    \"cargo fmt --check passes with no formatting issues\",\n    \"cargo clippy shows no new warnings from tracing changes\"\n  ],\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"PoolSnapshot.event_count field triggers a dead_code warning — an external linter keeps restoring it; the field is used in unit tests and is harmless\",\n    \"The notes field in SystemTraceEntry is always empty in the current implementation; systems do not yet emit intermediate notes (Trace verbosity). This is expected — downstream beads can add note injection by returning notes from system functions.\",\n    \"The with_sink constructor requires a 'static sink due to Box<dyn TraceSink>; tests work around this by using in-memory tracing and manually feeding ticks to a JsonLinesSink. A future improvement could add a lifetime parameter or Arc-based sharing.\"\n  ]\n}\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0fcbe72e-d9e8-4ae5-a92f-c4fbc2cd3ca8","total_cost_usd":7.877118249999998,"usage":{"input_tokens":970,"cache_creation_input_tokens":153550,"cache_read_input_tokens":10258617,"output_tokens":63936,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":153550,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[]